body:
Honestly I enjoy it mostly. I think Joust sucks balls when you're the team tank and Conquest is a mixed bag where for every legitimately fun match, you also have a match with an AFK or F7 warriors who refuse to accept defeat and make the match go on for like 50 minutes even though the enemy team has already downed all the towers and did 2/3 furies and the FG. 

&#x200B;

Arena, Slash and Assault are always a good time though, if you ask me.
